,"cmd-4533d76a15a245c8","cmd-27a56608fffd43e6","cmd-02113eb7fe1f4f95","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"Both material outcomes are satisfied with direct post-configuration and post-reboot behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is complete and coherent for both nodes: healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identities independently confirmed by lifecycle observations, and recovered time-service and synchronization state.","limitations":["The lifecycle snapshots do not inventory /etc, so retention of the two rollback configuration copies is inferred from their creation and the absence of a cleanup command in the complete executor timeline."]}
